 "source": "W4 quarterback starter bound",
 "tier": "leaky",
 "caveat": "LEAKY UPPER BOUND. Starters are derived post hoc from box-score pass attempts. The closing line knows the announced starter and there are no historical timestamped injury or depth-chart reports locally, so nothing here can be shown to be observable before kickoff. The best possible verdict is UPPER_BOUND_PASS, and nothing here enters cfb-structural-v6.1.",
 "definitions": "starter = the team's passer with the most pass attempts in that game; qb_changed = starter differs from the team's previous game starter; backup_start = starter differs from the team's season-to-date attempts leader over prior games (the first game of a season is 0, counted)",
 "interpretation_notes": [
  "qb_changed and backup_start are season-local: the first game of a season is 0 for both (counted in coverage), so an offseason starter change is not flagged.",
  "A game whose starter did not resolve (no pass attempts or no box score) leaves the feature missing and is dropped from the cohort; it does not update the team's state.",
  "Seasons 2022-2026 only; 2022 select rows end 2022-11-11 and so are few."
 ],
